{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Forced Entry a realistic horror escape sim about a girl who goes to stay at her estranged fathers mansion on Christmas week with her 2 friends while he is away on business in the quiet town of Newbridge where a serial killer has been active in the area for the past 2 years. <br> <br>After a night of partying in town with your friends you head back to the house for the after party however someone else is waiting inside the house for you to arrive. After getting knocked out you awake in the basement with a masked killer walking the hallways of the house. You must escape before its to late but it won't be easy.<br><br>- AVOID CREAKING FLOORBOARDS\u00a0<br>- FIND VARIOUS ITEMS LIKE TOOLS AND KEYS<br>- USE STEALTH AND STAY OUT OF THE MANIACS SIGHT<br><br>  Your friends have been captured by the sick maniac who likes to torture his victims before killing them as the desperate screams of your friends ring out through the hallways of the house you need to quietly find a way to escape before its to late. <br>  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843020/extras/45dc44342db7224d42b13403fa461ffe.poster.avif?t=1765898850\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843020/extras/45dc44342db7224d42b13403fa461ffe.webm?t=1765898850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>The powers out and this deadly butcher is listening and checking every sound some floorboards in the house are old and creaking if he hears you step on them he will quickly come to investigate if he see's you he will show you no mercy.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843020/extras/cd0fff2ba866b3bab0a3ceec2ff87a2f.poster.avif?t=1765898850\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843020/extras/cd0fff2ba866b3bab0a3ceec2ff87a2f.webm?t=1765898850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>He has made sure escaping won't be easy by securing the entire house to play his sick game of cat and mouse you will need to find various tools and keys in order to try escape his blood thirsty lust for death.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843020/extras/e788454aa8f8298a73bd7fbaada9e712.poster.avif?t=1765898850\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843020/extras/e788454aa8f8298a73bd7fbaada9e712.webm?t=1765898850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3843020?t=1765898850","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843020/3c653f77d53b05f39260c1881edf1d088a2e7914/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765898850","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843020/2555c8b43cb21823ef2acf3306c1fd48a2ceffef/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765898850","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843020/2555c8b43cb21823ef2acf3306c1fd48a2ceffef/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765898850","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Forced Entry a realistic horror escape sim about a girl who goes to stay at her estranged fathers mansion on Christmas week with her 2 friends while he is away on business in the quiet town of Newbridge where a serial killer has 